BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 572.0 Tm (physical conviction, the tight jaw, the fast heartbeat, the heat behind the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 558.4 Tm (ears, feels like deep knowledge. It feels like you are reading the situation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 544.8 Tm (But you are only reading the instrument that is reading the situation, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 531.2 Tm (instrument\222s settings were off before the situation arrived. These) Tj ET
